        },
        {
          "text": " neya ninye ilchumat te nkaji o Laitoriani o lchumat te nkaji o laiguanani, neya ninye pooki toki. Neya sii nena long'oi pooki e sahabu apa naaitobira Solomon; ",
          "type": "text",
