              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore ake tenelo olaiguanani enkaji o Laitoriani, nenapu olarriponi nena long'oi ayau enkaji e rripore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
